  "html": "<div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><h3 style=\"text-align: center\">Unser E-Wurf ist bereits wieder ein Jahr alt</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center\">19.11.2018</p>\n<hr class=\"fx-sep\"><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2018%2F11%2FE-Ebony-205x300.webp?alt=media&token=841aa7fd-b3b1-499e-9d47-0da660d59501\" alt=\"\" width=\"205\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2018%2F11%2FE-Epikur-225x300.webp?alt=media&token=d0ae9889-9aea-43f0-83f2-29c82b2822e7\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2018%2F11%2FE-Empress-300x220.webp?alt=media&token=98108998-8f48-46a3-a5de-24d3af2fae0e\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"220\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2018%2F11%2FE-Neo-225x300.webp?alt=media&token=15571ae1-042f-4ad8-85e3-8d905314c715\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2018%2F11%2FE-Egon-225x300.webp?alt=media&token=6f372aeb-41cf-41f5-9604-c126ec2cee66\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><span class=\"fx-img\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2018%2F11%2FE-Estella-225x300.webp?alt=media&token=49bf2bb3-8920-41fa-8e74-6c2b06fa9e52\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-6\"></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-3\"><h4 style=\"text-align: center\">Luan Umbra Fida</h4>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2017%2F10%2FFoto-Luan.webp?alt=media&token=4dad05b7-6eb9-4041-b36d-687baf993360\" alt=\"Luan\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-3\"><h4 style=\"text-align: center\">Lilith</h4>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2017%2F10%2FLilith-Foto.webp?alt=media&token=abc0582c-2e1d-46f9-b1bc-46046c3ade20\" alt=\"Lilith\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-6\"></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><div class=\"fx-title\"><h4 style=\"text-align: center\">Lilith hat am 19. November 2017 ihre  Welpen geworfen !</h4></div></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-6\"></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-3\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2017%2F09%2Flilith_nach_wurf-e1511980194759.webp?alt=media&token=8c271a50-bc91-42c5-8fc8-63e444db164f\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"218\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-3\"><p style=\"text-align: left\">Lilith wurde am 20. September erfolgreich von Leon Umbra Fida gedeckt.<br>\nWir hoffen auf gesunde und flat-typische Welpen um den 20. November.<br>\nAus dieser Verpaarung erwarten wir besonders arbeitsfreudige Flats,<br>\nda beide Eltern schon mehrmals mit „Judges Choice“ bei den Working<br>\nTests ausgezeichnet wurden.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><strong>Lilith hat am 19. November ihre  Welpen geworfen<br>\n– 5 Hündinnen und 4 Rüden<br>\n</strong><strong> mit einem Durchschnittsgewicht von 350 g. Alles bestens!</strong></p>\n</div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-6\"></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><hr class=\"fx-sep\"></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-1\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Unsere Welpen in den ersten 2 Wochen</strong></h2>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img zoom\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2017%2F09%2FE-Wurf-221117_1-300x169.webp?alt=media&token=56fe7bc0-c2cb-4245-aa68-fe1546a04f92\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img zoom\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2017%2F09%2FE-Wurf-221117_2-300x169.webp?alt=media&token=69474322-ef44-4950-bb7e-cce1b8599f21\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img zoom\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2017%2F09%2FE-Wurf-271117_2-300x169.webp?alt=media&token=b10a997e-4f80-4cc1-b2d1-09ab03c3b1a2\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></div></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"></div></div></div><div class=\"fx-section\"><div class=\"fx-row\"><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"></div><div class=\"fx-col w-1-5\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"fx-img zoom\" style=\"border:1px solid #346533;border-radius:20px\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/flat-xp-bilder/o/uploads%2F2017%2F1